## Version: 0.5.0
## SavedVariables: LefthyToolsDB, LefthyToolsChronicleDB, LefthyToolsBestiaryDB
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Wrench_01
## AddonCompartmentFunc: LefthyTools_OnAddonCompartmentClick

